ul.li:
Include codes from 

                  urn:iso:std:iso:3166
                 where code  matches (by regex)  [0-9]{3}

Include codes from 

                  urn:iso:std:iso:3166
                 where code  matches (by regex)  [A-Z]{2}

Include codes from 

                  urn:iso:std:iso:3166
                 where code  matches (by regex)  [A-Z]{3}
